{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% block title %}AI Accountant — Dashboard{% endblock %}
{% block body %}
<section class="hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Solana tax review workflow</p>
  <h1>AI Accountant for US Crypto Taxes</h1>
  <p class="lead">Classify Solana transactions, detect taxable events, find missing cost basis, and generate a CPA-ready review package.</p>
  {% if presentation_mode %}
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <form method="post" action="{{ url_for('demo_route') }}">
      <button type="submit" class="primary">Run US Tax Review</button>
    </form>
    <form method="post" action="{{ url_for('demo_route') }}">
      <button type="submit" class="secondary">View Sample Tax File</button>
    </form>
  </div>
  {% else %}
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a class="button primary" href="{{ url_for('tax_files_route') }}">Open Tax Files</a>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<section class="proof-grid">
  <article>
    <strong>Taxable event detection</strong>
    <span>Jupiter swaps, NFT sales, staking rewards, airdrops, and stablecoin exchanges are separated from support records.</span>
  </article>
  <article>
    <strong>Missing basis review</strong>
    <span>AI Accountant flags external wallet inflows, missing FMV, and lots that require CPA or taxpayer answers.</span>
  </article>
  <article>
    <strong>CPA-ready export</strong>
    <span>Draft Form 8949 fields, Schedule D summary inputs, review items, audit trail, and confidence scores stay traceable.</span>
  </article>
</section>

<section class="paste-form">
  <form method="post" action="{{ url_for('landing') }}">
    <label for="address">Solana wallet address</label>
    <input type="text" id="address" name="address" value="{{ address_input or '' }}"
           placeholder="86xCnPeV…" autocomplete="off" required>
    <button type="submit">Open Dashboard</button>
    {% if error %}<p class="form-error">{{ error }}</p>{% endif %}
  </form>
  <p class="muted">{% if presentation_mode %}Wallet dashboard remains available for raw Solana activity review. The guided tax review starts with Run US Tax Review.{% else %}Paste a Solana address above to fetch its activity, or open an existing tax file.{% endif %}</p>
</section>

<section class="report-section">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <h2>How It Works</h2>
      <p class="muted">CPA-ready answers for the most likely product and tax questions.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-grid">
    <article><strong>Is this real AI or rules?</strong><span>Core classification is deterministic for auditability. The AI layer explains decisions, prioritizes review items, and generates CPA-ready summaries.</span></article>
    <article><strong>Can it file taxes?</strong><span>No. It prepares a CPA-ready draft package. Final filing requires taxpayer or CPA review.</span></article>
    <article><strong>How do you avoid wrong tax advice?</strong><span>We use confidence scores, review blockers, missing-data flags, non-advice disclaimers, and an audit trail.</span></article>
    <article><strong>Why Solana?</strong><span>The workflow is built around Solana wallet activity: Jupiter swaps, staking rewards, SPL tokens, NFTs, wSOL, fees, and transaction signatures.</span></article>
    <article><strong>Why not a portfolio tracker?</strong><span>A tracker shows balances. AI Accountant classifies taxable events, detects cost basis gaps, explains tax impact, and prepares exportable tax records.</span></article>
  </div>
</section>

{% if notice %}
<section class="notice-panel"><p>{{ notice }}</p></section>
{% endif %}

<p class="muted">
  <a href="{{ url_for('wallets_route') }}">View cached wallets</a>
  ·
  <a href="{{ url_for('tax_files_route') }}">Manage Tax Files</a>
</p>
{% endblock %}
